WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Create tutorial: Make ads from a short brief, in your brand voice.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.600
Page 1 of 3: Create. Six short steps from a product to a ready ad.

3
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:07.906
Create takes you from a product to a finished ad in six short steps.

4
00:00:07.906 --> 00:00:18.405
Step 1, Product: what you sell, in plain words, with its price.

5
00:00:18.405 --> 00:00:23.252
Step 2, Platform: Google, Meta, TikTok or Pinterest. The ad is built in that platform’s structure.

6
00:00:23.252 --> 00:00:27.030
Step 3, Goal: what the ad should achieve, such as sales, traffic or awareness.

7
00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:32.424
Step 4, Format: an image ad, generated with AI or made from your own photo.

8
00:00:32.424 --> 00:00:39.175
Step 5, Customise, is optional: pick a saved audience, the ad language and the tone.

9
00:00:39.175 --> 00:00:43.503
Step 6, Review: everything in one place, including the credit cost, before anything is created.

10
00:00:43.503 --> 00:00:46.103
Page 2 of 3: Creative Testing. Write versions side by side and keep the strongest.

11
00:00:48.724 --> 00:00:50.769
Creative Testing writes several versions of an idea so you can compare them side by side.

12
00:00:50.769 --> 00:00:56.938
Choose what to vary (headlines, hooks, descriptions, calls to action or tone) and how many versions.

13
00:00:56.938 --> 00:01:01.586
Keep the strongest with Choose. Chosen versions go to My Content, ready for your campaigns.

14
00:01:01.586 --> 00:01:05.780
Results per version come only from an ad platform, once a campaign with them is published.

15
00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:08.380
Page 3 of 3: My Content. Everything you made, ready to reuse.

16
00:01:11.020 --> 00:01:13.888
My Content opens from Create. It holds every image, ad creative and piece of copy you made.

17
00:01:13.888 --> 00:01:23.029
Filter by type, search by product or text, and star your favourites.

18
00:01:23.029 --> 00:01:27.282
Everything here is ready to use in Campaign Builder and Launch.
